<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-EURO SIX-A-SIDE TOURNAMENT COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EURO SIX-A-SIDE TOURNAMENT COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results in the &quot;Euro</p>
<p>6ix's&quot; six-a-side tournament:</p>
<p>Final:</p>
<p> Ajax Amsterdam   2    AC Milan	   6</p>
<p>Third/Fourth place playoff (decided by six shoot-outs</p>
<p>each):</p>
<p> Glasgow Rangers  3    Liverpool	  3</p>
<p>(Rangers won in first round of sudden death)</p>
<p>First round-robin stage (on Monday):</p>
<p> Ajax Amsterdam   6    Glasgow Rangers  2</p>
<p> AC Milan	   5    Liverpool	  0</p>
<p> Ajax Amsterdam   2    AC Milan	   2</p>
<p> Glasgow Rangers  7    Liverpool	  3</p>
<p>Played Tuesday:</p>
<p> Ajax Amsterdam   8    Liverpool	  1</p>
<p> AC Milan	   3    Glasgow Rangers  3</p>
<p>Standings after first round:</p>
<p> 1. Ajax Amsterdam  3    2    1    0   16   5    7</p>
<p> 2. AC Milan	  3    1    2    0   10   5    5</p>
<p> 3. Glasgow Rangers 3    1    1    1   12  12    4</p>
<p> 4. Liverpool	 3    0    0    3    4  20    0</p>
